  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-900 via-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>❄️</span><span>2026年 冬〜年末年始旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      冬の味覚解禁（カニ・ふぐ・寒ブリ）や雪見露天・年末年始の宿泊枠は例年10月中旬〜11月上旬で満室が急増します。空室状況はお早めに確認を。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F8658%2F8658.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    👉 万座温泉 万座亭の極上名湯・にごり湯プランを見る →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"intro\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【群馬県】万座温泉　万座亭の魅力と宿泊満足度</h2>\n\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">群馬県・上信越高原国立公園の標高1,800mに広がる万座温泉の中でも、落ち着いた和の風情と温かなもてなしでリピーターが多い宿が「万座温泉 万座亭（まんざてい）」です。</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">木の薫り漂う青森ヒバ造りの名物「ログ露天風呂」では、真っ白に濁る濃厚な硫黄泉を標高1,800mの爽快な風とともに心ゆくまで味わい尽くすできます。</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"hotel-card\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-6\">温泉・客室・食事・駐車場アクセス情報</h2>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-3\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">万座温泉　万座亭</h3>\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.78 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/8658/8658.jpg\" alt=\"万座温泉　万座亭\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-stone-100\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p><strong>【群馬県】</strong> 群馬県</p>\n      <p><strong>【エリア】</strong> 万座・草津・四万</p>\n      <p><strong>【温泉・風呂】</strong> 万座温泉の白濁硫黄泉（白鉄泉）。竹林と青森ヒバでつくられた風情あふれる「ログ露天風呂」＆大浴場「万座温泉 万座亭」。</p>\n      <p><strong>【駐車場】</strong> 敷地内無料駐車場完備（約50台・万座ハイウェイドライブに最適）。</p>\n      <p><strong>【お食事】</strong> 群馬県産最高級「上州牛」のすき焼きやすき焼き、地元の山菜や嬬恋高原キャベツをあしらった和食会席。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F8658%2F8658.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm rounded-2xl shadow-lg\">\n      ✈️ 万座温泉　万座亭 の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-10 p-6 bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">🔗 【あわせて読みたい】群馬県・近隣エリアの人気旅特集</h3>\n  <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-800\">\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/shima-kaigen-guide\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">【2026最新】四万温泉 時わすれ 佳元の口コミ！全8室の大人の隠れ家と四万川絶景露天</a></li>\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/11130\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">尾瀬戸倉温泉　ふじや旅館＜群馬県＞の温泉・客室口コミと宿泊予約</a></li>\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/theme-graduation-student-budget-onsen-guide\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">【2026年最新】学生・グループ卒業旅行に人気！食べ放題バイキング＆コスパ最強温泉旅館特集</a></li>\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/20354\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">老神温泉　吟松亭　あわしまの温泉・客室口コミと宿泊予約</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n  <div class=\"border-b border-amber-200 pb-3 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-2\">\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n        🏨 万座温泉　万座亭 宿泊前に知っておきたい詳細スペック＆設備\n      </h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1\">万座温泉 万座亭のお風呂・お食事・館内設備・アクセス情報の詳細ガイド</p>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full border border-amber-300\">総合評価 ⭐ 4.43 (854件)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n    <!-- 温泉・お風呂 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          ♨️ 温泉・お風呂\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-amber-200\">お風呂 ★ 4.66 / 5.0</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>設備:</strong> 温泉・大浴場・露天風呂・サウナ・家族風呂・天然温泉・水風呂</li>\n        <li><strong>泉質:</strong> 硫黄泉</li>\n        <li><strong>効能:</strong> 胃腸病・糖尿病・リウマチ・神経病</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- お食事・グルメ -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          🍽️ お食事スタイル・こだわり\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-orange-700 bg-orange-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-orange-200\">夕食★4.39 / 朝食★4.33</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 spa